    {
      "title": "CDNs: Push vs Pull, Cache Keys, TTLs, Purging",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "CDNs: Push vs Pull, Cache Keys, TTLs, Purging",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Push vs Pull",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Pull",
                "Push"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Fill",
                  "Edge fetches on first miss",
                  "You upload ahead"
                ],
                [
                  "Effort",
                  "{green:Low}",
                  "You manage storage and sync"
                ],
                [
                  "Catch",
                  "First request is slow",
                  "Best for large, rarely changing files"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Cache Key and TTL",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Key = ==URL path + query string== (+ headers in `Vary`)",
                "Extra query params, `Vary: Cookie` or `User-Agent` fragment the cache",
                "`max-age` = browser, `s-maxage` = shared/CDN",
                "`public` lets the CDN store it, `private` does not",
                "Check the `X-Cache` header: HIT or MISS"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "http",
              "lines": [
                "Cache-Control: public, max-age=60, s-maxage=86400",
                "X-Cache: HIT"
              ],
              "note": "browser 60 s, CDN 1 day"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Purging and Mistakes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Purge by ==URL==, ==tag== (surrogate key) or ==wildcard==",
                "Slow, sometimes billed",
                "Prefer `app.3f9a.js` with a long TTL, short TTL on `index.html`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Caching `Set-Cookie` or personalized responses",
                "Forgetting to purge after a deploy",
                "No origin shield: a miss storm hits the origin"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "stale-while-revalidate",
              "text": "Keeps **serving** the stale copy while it refreshes in the background."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
